This tree is derived from "DGX Station GB300 serving research"
(https://github.com/original-el8/dgx-station-gb300-research, commit 7699ae54), Copyright 2026 Jason Cook,
Apache License 2.0. Derived files (each carries a header naming its source):
  - hook/peer_tier_v4.py      <- deepseek-v4.1-flash/m3/hook/peer_tier2.py (modified: 7,168 hidden, BF16 rows,
                                 handshake table, per-layer warm counts)
  - hook/e3_hook.py           <- deepseek-v4.1-flash/m3/hook/mega_peer_hook.py (rewritten for vLLM's generic
                                 RoutedExperts / marlin MXFP4 path used by deepseek_v4 in nightly-af7f9488)
  - sidecar/peer_server_v4.py <- deepseek-v4.1-flash/m3/sidecar/peer_server2.py (modified: V4-Pro geometry,
                                 per-layer warm counts, per-EP-rank expert selection, A16 default)
  - hook/sitecustomize.py     <- deepseek-v4.1-flash/m3/hook/sitecustomize.py, itself modified from J&M Recipes
                                 (Copyright 2026 J&M Recipes, MIT License; licenses/J-M-Recipes-MIT.txt)

The sidecar imports b12x (https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x, master 2cc7f66a) at run time; b12x is not
vendored here.

